                "headline": "Special Marine Warning issued August 28 at 11:12AM EDT until August 28 at 12:15PM EDT by NWS Mount Holly NJ",
                "description": "SMWPHI\n\nThe National Weather Service in Mount Holly NJ has issued a\n\n* Special Marine Warning for...\nDelaware Bay...\n\n* Until 1215 PM EDT.\n\n* At 1109 AM EDT, a strong thunderstorm was located near Fourteen\nFoot Bank Light, moving east at 20 knots.\n\nHAZARD...Wind gusts 34 knots or greater.\n\nSOURCE...Radar.\n\nIMPACT...Small craft could be damaged in briefly higher winds and\nsuddenly higher waves.\n\n* Locations impacted include...\nMiah Maull Light, Brandywine Shoal Light, Fourteen Foot Bank Light,\nand East Point.",
